FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextWifeAway::
	.string "My husband is at METEOR FALLS.\nHe went to collect a sample.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextWifeHome::
	.string "He returned safely from the summit.\nThank you for looking into it.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextWifeThanks::
	.string "He is studying the sample again.\nThis time, without any MAGMA help!$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextNoStone::
	.string "COZMO: The mountain is safe now.\nThe device still holds my sample.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextStored::
	.string "COZMO: The sample is in your PC.\nPlease withdraw it for the study.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextAsk::
	.string "COZMO: You recovered the METEORITE!\nMay I study it here?\p"
	.string "I can offer TM27, RETURN,\nas thanks for your field work.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextDecline::
	.string "COZMO: Of course. Keep it safe.\nMy offer will still stand.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextFull::
	.string "COZMO: Your BAG has no room.\nKeep the sample until you return.$"

FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Mountain_TextThanks::
	.string "COZMO: Thank you! RETURN grows\nstronger with a trusted partner.\p"
	.string "Your field notes and this sample\nwill make a fine research record.$"
